{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SLAUGHTEREON you have to fight your way floor by floor, to the very bottom of the dungeon. But don't expect conquered floors to be safe for long, as your enemy won't just patiently wait for you to come after him!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete grim story campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop the Evil Mage from opening numeric artificial dungeons, where only cynic slaughter awaits those who got lured into with gold. Each story level has different task you'll have to complete in order to proceed further. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every unit has abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some can build, some run faster, some can shoot or perform magic. Various items require a specialist to use them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't leave fallen soldiers on the battlefield!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People won't fight for those who treat them as disposables. Extract defeated warriors to the surface, or else you couldn't hire anyone for replacement for any money!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926200?t=1757090701","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926200?t=1757090701","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926200/e3b59f4e9bf788c66f1998619451d5238cd5d172/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757090701","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926200/e3b59f4e9bf788c66f1998619451d5238cd5d172/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757090701","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood, gore and violence on low-polygonal humans and fantasy creatures"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SLAUGHTEREON you have to fight your way floor by floor, to the very bottom of the dungeon. But don't expect conquered floors to be safe for long, as your enemy won't just patiently wait for you to come after him!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete grim story campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop the Evil Mage from opening numeric artificial dungeons, where only cynic slaughter awaits those who got lured into with gold. Each story level has different task you'll have to complete in order to proceed further. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every unit has abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some can build, some run faster, some can shoot or perform magic. Various items require a specialist to use them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't leave fallen soldiers on the battlefield!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People won't fight for those who treat them as disposables. Extract defeated warriors to the surface, or else you couldn't hire anyone for replacement for any money!</p>","developers":["Ilya Efimov"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926200/a8bedf27b13eca17f0c161a3f7b62ff4b68acbcd/header.jpg?t=1757090701","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 core 64-bit CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257190236,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190236/movie480.mp4?t=1757090699","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190236/movie_max.mp4?t=1757090699"},"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190236/74f44e3f88d50ed94149b29151ac60ca83a33d7d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757090699","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190236/movie480_vp9.web